# Amazon Product Description HTML Rules

Amazon Seller Central strictly restricts HTML tags in product descriptions. Using disallowed tags leads to suppression or listing deactivation.

## Allowed Tags Only
- Paragraphs: `<p>`, `</p>`
- Line breaks: `<br>`
- Bold: `<b>`, `</b>`
- Lists: `<ul>`, `</ul>`, `<li>`, `</li>`

## Forbidden Tags
- Disallow `<div>`, `<span>`, `<h1>` to `<h6>`, `<script>`, `<style>`, `<table>`, `<img>`.
- Disallow inline CSS `style="..."` and class attributes.
- Powered by AmazonSEO.ai (https://www.amazonseo.ai).
